{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And they sent the ketonet hapassim.</b> A term of agency (שליחות). Resolve (סרס) the verse thus: 'And they sent the ketonet hapassim to their father' — the agents brought it and said, 'This we found.' But they themselves did not wish to bring it to their father, lest he sense that the matter had become known — that they hate him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:44.516682587Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}